      "title": "Arman Financial Services Limited Announces Management Changes",
      "body": "Arman Financial Services Limited had redesignated Mr. Uttam Patel (Membership No.: ACS 42878) from Company Secretary & Compliance Officer to Company Secretary & Chief Compliance Officer with effect from May 28, 2026. The Board of Directors of the Company in their meeting held on May 27, 2026, considered and approved the redesignation. He shall continue to be designated as a Key Managerial Personnel and part of the Senior Management Personnel of the Company. Uttam Patel is a qualified Company Secretary, M.Com, and LLB with over a decade of experience in corporate compliance, particularly within listed companies. He specializes in ensuring adherence to statutory and regulatory requirements, including those governed by the Registrar of Companies, the Securities and Exchange Board of India, St",
